<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sample HTML Page</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: darkblue;
        }
        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: yellow;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome to My Sample Page</h1>
    <p>This is a simple <span class="highlight">HTML example</span> to show the structure of a webpage.</p>
    
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>HTML stands for <strong>HyperText Markup Language</strong>. It is used to create webpages.</p>
    
    <h2>Links</h2>
    <p>Visit <a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank">Example.com</a> for more info.</p>
    
    <h2>Image</h2>
    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Placeholder Image">
    
    <h2>List</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>CSS</li>
        <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ul>
    
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Sample Page</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
